  "translation": "Gomme Elisha a dula ka ntlong ya gagwe, gomme bahumagolwane ba dutše ba dula ⟨את⟩ le yena; gomme ⟨kgoši⟩ a romela monna go tšwa pele ga gagwe, e sa le pele ga ge moromagna a ka fihla go yena, gomme yena a bolela go bahumagolwane: Na le bone gore morwa wa mmolai yo o rometše go ntšha ⟨את⟩ hlogo ya ka? Lebang, ge moromagna a fihla, tswalelang lebati, gomme mo kgamanyeng ka lebating. A ga se modumo wa maoto a mong wa gagwe ka morago ga gagwe?",
